{"3347950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knockout Battle", "steam_appid": 3347950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YEET YOUR FRIENDS INTO ORBIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knockout Battle is a chaotic multiplayer party game where friendships go to die. Punch, blast, explode, and launch your friends into space. If they're still standing, you're simply not using enough rockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/e594a61baa191459cc1ce49ce4846a5c.poster.avif?t=1786375470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/e594a61baa191459cc1ce49ce4846a5c.webm?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/e594a61baa191459cc1ce49ce4846a5c.mp4?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY WEAPON IS A BAD DECISION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring absolute chaos with an arsenal of ridiculous weapons. Throw TNT like it's confetti. Fire rockets at everything that moves. Blast your rivals with revolvers and blasters. Bonk them with Thor's Hammer. Deflect attacks with a lightsaber. There are no bad choices. Only louder ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/a56ac6078f13715b2498c62290400421.poster.avif?t=1786375470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/a56ac6078f13715b2498c62290400421.webm?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/a56ac6078f13715b2498c62290400421.mp4?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRINK QUESTIONABLE POTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need an unfair advantage? Chug a potion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an absolute Giant. Shrink into a tiny menace. Sprint around the map at ridiculous speed. Hit so hard your friends start questioning their life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every potion turns the match into even bigger chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/05948bce5b4a0ea7dc622495e3836cfc.poster.avif?t=1786375470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/05948bce5b4a0ea7dc622495e3836cfc.webm?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/05948bce5b4a0ea7dc622495e3836cfc.mp4?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHEN IN DOUBT, PRESS THE NUKE BUTTON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes rockets aren't enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes TNT isn't enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your friends have been annoying for the last five rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop a NUKE and let everyone deal with the consequences.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/7ca280783d842bc168367d696b5bf83b.poster.avif?t=1786375470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/7ca280783d842bc168367d696b5bf83b.webm?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/7ca280783d842bc168367d696b5bf83b.mp4?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURE PARTY GAME CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're dodging rockets, spamming explosives, or laughing as your best friend gets deleted from existence, every match is packed with ridiculous moments you'll immediately want to replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nobody is flying through the air, you're doing it wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/bf454d2e9930c7ee265febc2eaf24a33.poster.avif?t=1786375470\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/bf454d2e9930c7ee265febc2eaf24a33.webm?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347950/extras/bf454d2e9930c7ee265febc2eaf24a33.mp4?t=1786375470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Chaotic multiplayer battles for 2 to 10 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Launch your friends into space with ridiculous weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Use rockets, TNT, revolvers, blasters, Thor's Hammer, lightsabers, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Drink potions to grow huge, shrink tiny, move faster, or hit harder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interactive maps packed with traps, hazards, and destruction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Endless combinations of weapons, potions, and hilarious accidents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explosions. Lots and lots of explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Skins (all are free)</p><p cla